(SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS SPECIFICATION \(SRS\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Invoice Management Module - Iconic Hishab Accounting Software) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Prepared for: Iconic Hishab Accounting Software) Tj
T*
(Prepared date: 14-Sep-2026) Tj
T*
(Document type: Functional and non-functional requirements specification) Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(==========) Tj
T*
(This SRS defines the functional, data, security, accounting, reporting, and quality) Tj
T*
(requirements for the Invoice Management module. The module supports invoice creation, draft) Tj
T*
(management, payment collection, refund posting, cancellation, restore-as-draft, print/PDF) Tj
T*
(output, summary reporting, and permission-controlled access.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Scope) Tj
T*
(========) Tj
T*
(- Create invoices for customers selected from Particular Accounts, with customer display) Tj
T*
(based on company name/account name.) Tj
T*
(- Save draft invoices without voucher posting and finalize drafts later with automatic) Tj
T*
(accounting vouchers.) Tj
T*
( - Maintain date-wise payment history and preserve it during invoice edits.) Tj
T*
(- Allow due payment collection, payment edit, and refund workflow from the Edit Invoice) Tj
T*
(page; View Invoice remains read-focused with top action buttons.) Tj
T*
(- Show invoice list with invoice number, customer name, item names, date, total, paid, due,) Tj
T*
(status, and allowed actions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Definitions) Tj
T*
(==============) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Term | Meaning) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Draft Invoice | Invoice saved for future editing; no accounting voucher is posted.) Tj
T*
(Final Invoice | Invoice created/finalized and included in accounting postings and reports.) Tj
T*
(Initial Paid Amount | Payment captured at invoice create/finalize time.) Tj
T*
(Payment History | Date-wise records of payments/refunds against an invoice.) Tj
T*
(Voucher Posting | Automatic creation of Receipt, Journal, Payment, or Reversal voucher) Tj
T*
(entries linked to invoice events.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Actors and Roles) Tj
T*
(===================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Actor/Role | Responsibility) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Super Admin | Full module setup, permission assignment, and unrestricted invoice operations.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
