(Authorized Accounting User | Create, update, collect payment, refund, cancel, and report) Tj
T*
(based on assigned permissions and branch access.) Tj
T*
(Read-only User | View list/details/reports only when Invoice read permission is granted.) Tj
T*
(Branch Context | Every invoice operation must be scoped by selected branch ID.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Functional Requirements) Tj
T*
(==========================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ID | Requirement | Priority) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(FR-01 | Create a new invoice with customer, dates, items, rate/price, quantity, totals,) Tj
T*
(initial paid amount, and payment account. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-02 | Validate invoice quantity as a whole number with minimum value 1. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-03 | Save an invoice as Draft without creating Receipt or Journal voucher. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-04 | Finalize a Draft invoice and automatically create required vouchers. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-05 | Automatically calculate subtotal, grand total, paid amount, due amount, and status.) Tj
T*
(| High) Tj
T*
(FR-06 | Preserve existing payment history when a final invoice item price or quantity is) Tj
T*
(edited. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-07 | Recalculate invoice status after edit; if paid amount equals new grand total, status) Tj
T*
(becomes PAID. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-08 | Prevent invalid update where invoice total becomes less than already collected net) Tj
T*
(payments unless refund/adjustment is handled. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-09 | Collect due payment with account, amount, date, method/reference/note and create) Tj
T*
(linked Receipt voucher. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-10 | Allow editing payment history entries only for partially paid invoices and) Tj
T*
(recalculate invoice totals. | Medium) Tj
T*
(FR-11 | Support refund posting with payment account, amount, refund date, and note; refund) Tj
T*
(appears in history and report. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-12 | Allow invoice cancellation and reverse active accounting postings automatically. |) Tj
T*
(High) Tj
T*
(FR-13 | Allow cancelled invoices to be restored as Draft with paid/due reset and vouchers) Tj
T*
(removed from active flow. | Medium) Tj
T*
(FR-14 | Allow permanent delete only for Draft or Cancelled invoices. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-15 | Provide Invoice Summary Report with date/status filters, totals, paid, refund, due,) Tj
T*
(and status-wise rows. | High) Tj
T*
(FR-16 | Provide Print/PDF output from details/report pages; list page shall not include) Tj
T*
(Print/PDF buttons. | Medium) Tj
T*
(FR-17 | Show active menu tick/selection state for all invoice menu items. | Medium) Tj
T*
(FR-18 | Provide a customer + action near customer dropdown to navigate to/Create Particular) Tj
T*
(Account. | Medium) Tj
T*
(FR-19 | Enforce Invoice create/read/update/delete permissions and branch permission checks.) Tj
T*
(| High) Tj
T*
(FR-20 | Record invoice audit logs for create, update, finalize, payment, refund, cancel,) Tj
T*
(restore, delete, and reversal events. | Medium) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
